WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.960
Welcome back.

00:00:07.960 --> 00:00:13.080
In our last session, you set the stage for a championship season.

00:00:13.080 --> 00:00:16.660
This week, we get into the data.

00:00:16.660 --> 00:00:17.842
In elite sports,

00:00:17.842 --> 00:00:23.380
teams spend millions on scouting reports because you can't design a winning

00:00:23.380 --> 00:00:28.260
game plan without first understanding the talent.

00:00:28.260 --> 00:00:32.560
In leadership, the best coaches do the same.

00:00:32.560 --> 00:00:38.820
This lesson is about becoming a student of your talent, but it starts with an honest

00:00:38.820 --> 00:00:42.500
scouting report on yourself.

00:00:42.500 --> 00:00:45.980
This is not about what you've heard before,

00:00:45.980 --> 00:00:49.540
but what you condition yourself to do daily.

00:00:49.540 --> 00:00:54.180
To coach your player, you must first lead yourself.

00:00:54.180 --> 00:00:55.569
In our next video,

00:00:55.569 --> 00:01:00.740
we'll start that process by creating your own leadership blueprint,

00:01:00.740 --> 00:01:02.900
your M.V.P. plus V.
